{"title":"2002 JBMO","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>2002 JBMO</b> problems and solutions. The 6th JBMO was held in Târgu-Mureş, Romania in 2002.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_JBMO_Problems\" title=\"2002 JBMO Problems\">2002 JBMO Problems</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_JBMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2002 JBMO Problems/Problem 1\"> Problem 1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_JBMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2002 JBMO Problems/Problem 2\"> Problem 2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_JBMO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2002 JBMO Problems/Problem 3 (page does not exist)\"> Problem 3</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_JBMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2002 JBMO Problems/Problem 4 (page does not exist)\"> Problem 4</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_JBMO&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Junior_Balkan_Mathematical_Olympiad\" title=\"Junior Balkan Mathematical Olympiad\">Junior Balkan Mathematical Olympiad</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=JBMO_Problems_and_Solutions,_with_authors\" title=\"JBMO Problems and Solutions, with authors\">JBMO Problems and Solutions, with authors</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competitions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competitions\">Mathematics competitions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competition_resources\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competition resources\">Mathematics competition resources</a></li></ul>\n<table c